     "summary": "Rooms, furniture, colours and size adjectives. Always learn a noun with its article.",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "tip",
       "text": "German nouns are always capitalised and have a gender: der (masculine), die (feminine) or das (neuter). Learn them as a pair: der Tisch, not just Tisch."
      },
